# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Institutional floor plans — NEVER commit these.
# VIT-provided drawings are held under a commitment that they will not be
# published or redistributed. Only the derived room/corridor coordinates in
# app/assets/campuses/** may be committed. Git history is very hard to scrub,
# so keep these out in the first place.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
plans/
floorplans/
*.dwg
*.dxf
*.rvt

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Flutter/Dart build output lives under app/, and app/.gitignore covers it,
# but repeat the big ones here so a stray build directory anywhere is ignored.
build/
.dart_tool/

*.pdf
